            "review_title": "Review at Me & An Vegetarian",
            "review_text": "Lisa\nGin Gin, Australia37 contributions\n0\nWatch the prices!\nMar 2026 • Friends\nSo I went for a solo meal here a couple of days ago and was really happy with the food and general ambience of the place. This evening I went again, taking my friend along too. \nSame staff there but the girl on the front desk was unhelpful and made out that she couldn’t understand that my friend was asking for: pepper. And then, when we went down to pay, the docket said 100000 for an item that was 95000VD. The same girl said it was an old price and that there should have been a new price sticker on there but it must have fallen off. Incidentally, her English was pretty food good now. We decided just to pay it. But then I noticed another item was billed for 120000 when the menu said 115000. She tried it again, the story about a sticker having fallen off, but this time I stood my ground and refused to pay the extra 5000. It’s a shame this happened because, prior to it, I would probably have given them 5 stars.\nFood was pretty good again bút not spectacular . .\nRead more\nWritten March 24, 2026",
            "rating": 3.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
